---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Support — Field Notes"
  description="How to support the writing on Field Notes."
>
  <h1>Support</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Everything on this site stays free to read. If a post saved you a week of work, there will
    soon be a way to say thanks.
  </p>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>One-off support</h2>
    <p>
      The payment button is not live yet — the merchant account is still being reviewed.
      It will appear here as a card payment option, no account required on your side.
    </p>
    <!-- TODO(payments): embed the PayPal payment button / link here once the individual-seller account passes review. -->
  </div>

  <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
  <p>
    Reading, arguing with the method in the comments where the post is discussed, and sending
    the post to one person who needs it — all of that moves this further than a tip does.
  </p>
</Base>
